<title>POLAND: Petrobank Q4 net falls to PLN 3.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Petrobank Q4 net falls to PLN 3.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrobank SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.72    vs   6.76</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 5.72    vs   6.76</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.50    vs   7.22</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.01</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   21.49    vs  19.19</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   1.41    vs   0.81</p>
<p>    income tax refund		    2.22    vs   0.46</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		    14.37    vs  17.55</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			14.37    vs  17.55</p>
<p>    net profit			     8.85    vs  16.66</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
